      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n**Who:**\n- Illusionist Jerup [ _Enchanter Spells 1-25_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 1 Hour\n**Level:** | 55\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ethereal Parchment [item=16329]\n- Glyphed Rune Word [item=16562]\n- Spectral Parchment [item=16493]\n**Era:** | !Planes of Power\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Enchanter\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 22 18:12:34 2002\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Illusionist Jerup is a female gnome in a white robe, located one level down from the library's entrance.\nYour Location is 1.78, 1073.56, -62.12\nYou say, 'Hail, Illusionist Jerup'\nIllusionist Jerup says 'Greetings traveler and welcome to the Plane of Knowledge! I am so pleased to see so many eager minds among us -- for it has been so long since I have had the meaningful presence of a pupil. If by chance you practice the art of Enchantments, then I might be of service to you. I have penned many spells from memory as a wandering enchanter and scholar of Norrath's history and though these spells are nothing unique or rare unto your world, they may provide some aid to you while you are here. Also, if you happen upon a seemingly meaningless item of arcane nature -- you will recognize these specific items I speak of by their corporeal state of existence -- then do not hesitate to take them up and return them to me. I know a thing or two regarding planar magic and can turn these seemingly mundane items into enchantments of great power.'\nGiving her either an Ethereal Parchment or a Spectral Parchment will give you the same spoken response.\nIllusionist Jerup accepts the item quite eagerly. With wide-eyes, the enchanter carefully examines every aspect of the fledgling arcane item. Eventually, she begins to weave a soft chant of arcane words -- their nature familiar to you of the art of enchantment, though they remain foreign in dialect and meaning. Eventually, the enchanter grows silent and the object cradled in her hands is whole and born anew. Golden runes line the tangible parchment -- runes of arcane enchantment. The enchantress then extends the item to you in gracious and unconditional offering, ''You have done well in recovering this, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I am quite surprised that you were able to find one, for they are rare indeed. In any case, I have turned it into something that may prove useful to you as your journeys upon the planes continue.'\nHand in Ethereal Parchments, Spectral Parchments, and Glyphed Rune Words to Illusionist Jerup for a random spell.\nEthereal Parchments give level 61 and 62 spells.\nSpectral Parchments give level 63 and 64 spells.\nGlyphed Rune Words give level 65 spells.\n- Spell: Aeldorb's Animation [item=16606]\n- Spell: Arcane Rune [item=16646]\n- Spell: Beckon [item=16607]\n- Spell: Bliss [item=16619]\n- Spell: Boggle [item=16592]\n- Spell: Command of Druzzil [item=16620]\n- Spell: Greater Fetter [item=16593]\n- Spell: Guard of Druzzil [item=16609]\n- Spell: Howl of Tashan [item=16594]\n- Spell: Illusion: Froglok [item=16623]\n- Spell: Insanity [item=16621]\n- Spell: Jitterskin [Norrath's Keepers]\n- Spell: Jitterskin [Dark Reign]\n- Spell: Night's Dark Terror [item=16614]\n- Spell: Pacification [item=16611]\n- Spell: Rune of Zebuxoruk [item=16591]\n- Spell: Shield of Maelin [item=16622]\n- Spell: Shield of the Arcane [item=16605]\n- Spell: Sleep [item=16615]\n- Spell: Speed of Vallon [item=16612]\n- Spell: Strangle [item=16613]\n- Spell: Torment of Scio [item=16616]\n- Spell: Tranquility [item=16617]\n- Spell: Uproar [item=16618]\n- Spell: Vallon's Quickening [item=16624]\n- Spell: Voice of Quellious [item=166