      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n**Who:**\n- Vicar Ceraen [ _Cleric Spells 1-25_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 46\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ethereal Parchment [item=16329]\n- Glyphed Rune Word [item=16562]\n- Spectral Parchment [item=16493]\n**Era:** | !Planes of Power\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Cleric\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 28 20:39:14 2002\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Vicar Ceraen may be found at +115, +930, -30._\nYou say, 'Hail, Vicar Ceraen'\nVicar Ceraen says 'Greetings, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I am Ceraen, priest of Tunare and resident of New Tanaan for over three centuries of my existence. Do not fear those whom may have been your enemy upon the prime. The scholars are equal and without bias toward one another, thus there is no safer place in the cosmos than New Tanaan. Each resident strives to bring knowledge closer to the curious and willing, and I am not exempt from this. If you are a priest in your world and seek to gain a higher understanding of the divine power that your faith has allowed you to wield, then perhaps what spells I have penned from memory of your world would be of use. I have also mastered levels in the workings of planar magic and its chaotic ways of forming upon the manifested planes. If by chance you come across a fledgling arcane item -- you will know it for its incorporeal state -- then do not hesitate to bring it to me. I may be able to infuse it with the powers of the divine and forge from it a spell of priestly might.'\n_Hand in Ethereal and Spectral Parchments and Glyphed Rune Words to Vicar Ceraen for a random spell._\n_Ethereal Parchments give level 61 and 62 spells._\n_Spectral Parchments give level 63 and 64 spells._\n_Glyphed Rune Words give level 65 spells._\n_61 - Spell: Faith_\n_61 - Spell: Symbol of Kazad_\n_61 - Spell: Tarnation_\n_61 - Spell: Ward of Gallantry_\n_62 - Spell: Blessing of Reverence_\n_62 - Spell: Condemnation_\n_62 - Spell: Greater Immobilize_\n_62 - Spell: Sermon of Penitence_\n_62 - Spell: Supernal Elixir_\n_62 - Spell: Virtue_\n_63 - Spell: Hammer of Damnation_\n_63 - Spell: Kazad's Mark_\n_63 - Spell: Sound of Might_\n_63 - Spell: Supernal Light_\n_64 - Spell: Catastrophe_\n_64 - Spell: Destroy Undead_\n_64 - Spell: Mark of Kings_\n_64 - Spell: Petrifying Earth_\n_64 - Spell: Word of Replenishment_\n_65 - Spell: Armor of the Zealot_\n_65 - Spell: Hand of Virtue_\n_65 - Spell: Mark of the Righteous_\n_65 - Spell: Pacification_\n_65 - Spell: Yaulp VI_\n_65 - Spell: the Silent Command_\nVicar Ceraen takes the arcane item with great care and respect from you. For several moments the priest seems to enter a state of contemplative meditiation upon the arcane planar item. Suddenly, he begins a slow, soft chant -- a prayer whose dialect is unknown to your ears. Eventually, the arcane item in his hand begins to waver into this existence, its corporeal state rendered beneath the priest's chanting. As he grows quiet and calm once more, the priest hands the corporeal item to you -- the runes of divine power etched upon the tangible scroll, 'This should be of great use to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Use its power wisely.'\n**Submitted by:** Ihnanna\n- Spell: Armor of the Zealot [item=16881]\n- Spell: Blessing of Reverence [item=30060]\n- Spell: Catastrophe [item=16841]\n- Spell: Condemnation [item=16870]\n- Spell: Death's Despair [Norrath Keeper's]\n- Spell: Death's Despair [Dark Reign]\n- Spell: Deistic Bellow [Dark Reign]\n- Spell: Deistic Bellow [Norrath Keeper's]\n- Spell: Destroy Undead [item=16878]\n- Spell: Faith [item=16865]\n- Spell: Greater Immobilize [item=16705]\n- Spell: Hammer of Damnation [item=16874]\n- Spell: Hand of Virtue [item=16882]\n- Spell: Kazad's Mark [item=16875]\n- Spell: Mark of Kings [item=16879]\n- Spell: Mark of the Righteous [item=16883]\n- Spell: Pacification [item=16611]\n- Spell: Petrifying Earth [item=16718]\n- Spell: Sermon of Penitence [item=16871]\n- Spell: Sound of Might [item=16876]\n- Spell: Supernal Elixir [item=16872]\n- Spell: Supernal Light [item=16877]\n- Spell: Symbol of Kazad [item=16867]\n- Spell: Tarnation [item=16868]\n- Spell: Virtue [item=16873]\n- Spell: Ward of Gallantry [item=16869]\n- Spell: Word of Replenishment [item=16880]\n- Spell: Yaulp VI [item=16886]\n- Spell: the Silent Command [item=16884]",
