      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n**Who:**\n- Elementalist Somat [ _Magician Spells 1-25_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 60\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ethereal Parchment [item=16329]\n- Glyphed Rune Word [item=16562]\n- Spectral Parchment [item=16493]\n**Era:** | !Planes of Power\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Magician\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Oct 30 20:33:22 2002\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Elementalist Somat is a green-robed vendor found at location 64, 1110, 33 on the second floor of the Plane of Knowledge library. (He's also on the Find list under \"(Magician Spells)\".)_\nYou say, 'Hail, Elementalist Somat'\nElementalist Somat says 'Greetings, traveler! I am Somat, Elementalist extraordinaire and one of several of my trade here in New Tanaan. We have all spent much time preparing for your arrival and hope that our time is not in vain. If you are a wielder of the elemental forces, then come and browse my inventory, friend! I may hold a spell or two that might pique your interest. Also, if you perhaps hold a seemingly mundane item of arcane relation that you found in your travels upon the planes, then do not hesitate to let me have a look at it. Don't worry -- we are not thieves here! Rather, we wish to aid you and I so love dabbling in the chaos of planar magic!'\n_For Level 61/62 spells, give him an Ethereal Parchment. For Level 63/64 spells, give him a Spectral Parchment. For Level 65 spells, give him a Glyphed Rune Word._\nElementalist Somat takes the planar arcane item and examines it with a strange glance in his eye. At first he seems overly excited -- like a child who has been handed a new toy, but then his glance changes into something that had previously seemed impossible of his charming features -- a stern seriousness. The gnome closes his eyes and begins a soft chant beneath his breath. The words are barely audible beneath the slow, gentle vibration that rings through the air around the both of you. The item seems to grow more real and tangible, its incorporeal state completely rent beneath the magician's spell. The gnome eventually opens his eyes and scans the arcane runes, scribed in fiery red, pale blue, crystal, and a deep emerald hue. He then nods in approval and extends the scroll to you, 'There you go, friend! This should do quite nicely, indeed!'\n_The spell you receive is random._\n**Submitted by:** Artulyn Starsummoner\n- Spell: Belt of Magi'Kot [item=16888]\n- Spell: Black Steel [item=16905]\n- Spell: Blade of Walnan [item=16889]\n- Spell: Blade of the Kedge [item=16906]\n- Spell: Burnout V [item=16898]\n- Spell: Call of the Arch Mage [item=16913]\n- Spell: Child of Ro [item=16907]\n- Spell: Destroy Summoned [item=16859]\n- Spell: Elemental Barrier [item=16971]\n- Spell: Elemental Silence [item=16908]\n- Spell: Fist of Ixiblat [item=16900]\n- Spell: Flameshield of Ro [item=16891]\n- Spell: Girdle of Magi'Kot [item=16910]\n- Spell: Maelstrom of Ro [item=55913]\n- Spell: Maelstrom of Thunder [item=16911]\n- Spell: Malosinia [item=16711]\n- Spell: Planar Renewal [item=16912]\n- Spell: Rathe's Son [item=16915]\n- Spell: Servant of Marr [item=16901]\n- Spell: Shield of Maelin [item=16622]\n- Spell: Shield of the Arcane [item=16605]\n- Spell: Summon Glowing Bauble [item=16892]\n- Spell: Summon Jewelry Bag [item=16909]\n- Spell: Summon Platinum Choker [item=16893]\n- Spell: Summon Runed Mantle [item=16894]\n- Spell: Summon Sapphire Bracelet [item=16895]\n- Spell: Summon Spiked Ring [item=16896]\n- Spell: Sun Storm [item=16902]\n- Spell: Sun Vortex [item=16916]\n- Spell: Talisman of Return [item=16903]\n- Spell: Ward of Xegony [item=16897]\n- Spell: Xegony's Phantasmal Guard [item=16904]",
