      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n**Who:**\n- Cavalier Waut [ _Paladin Spells 1-25_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 60\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ethereal Parchment [item=16329]\n- Glyphed Rune Word [item=16562]\n- Spectral Parchment [item=16493]\n**Era:** | !Planes of Power\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Paladin\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 7 21:09:35 2002\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Cavalier Waut may be found on the fourth floor of the library at +85, +1045._\nYou say, 'Hail, Cavalier Waut'\nCavalier Waut says 'Good day t'ye, traveler. The adepts of New Tanaan 'ave worked very laboriously t'properly welcome ye t'the Plane of Knowledge. Many of us 'ave delved into the past lives of our ventures upon Norrath an' 'ave brought forth from the recesses of our memories the spells that we once wielded as might t'our cause. Now, we no longer be needin' them, but we understand that ye may very well find them t'be of use yet. Oh, and if ye find an item of arcane nature though it seems t'be mundane or useless t'ye, dinnae disregard it! The planes 'old many items that are not what they seem, friend. Return such incorporeal runes and scrolls t'me and I shall make them spells worhty of any crusading paladin!'\n_Bring Waut various parchments for PoP spells in return._\nUpon turn in,\nCavalier Waut accepts the item carefully, studying it with great caution as she handles it in her small hands. The paladin then nods softly to herself as if in recognition or preparation and then closes her eyes. The dwarf's voice begins to spill softly across the area in a divine chant of reverence and prayer. As the dwarf speaks her indeciferable words, the item in her hand seems to grow corporeal and real. Runes form upon it in silvery script that seem to shimmer in the torch-cast light of Myrist. Eventually, she opens her eyes and inspects the item for a final time. Nodding to herself once more in satisfaction, she hands the scroll to you with a warm smile, ''This should de ye good, m'friend, I guarantee! Be careful, though, for this be a powerful spell not t'be underestimated or used without caution or respect.'\nEthereal Parchments will yield you 61-62nd level spells.\nSpectral Parchments will yield you 63-64th level spells.\nGlyphed Rune Words will yield you 65th level spells.\nLevel: 61\nGreater Immobilize\nTouch of Nife\nLevel: 62\nCrusader's Touch\nForce of Akilae\nWard of Nife\nDeny Undead\nLevel: 63\nPious Might\nLight of Nife\nLevel: 64\nAura of the Crusader\nQuellious' Word of Serenity\nSupernal Cleansing\nLevel: 65\nShackles of Tunare\nWave of Marr\nBrell's Stalwart Shield\n- Spell: Aura of the Crusader [item=16769]\n- Spell: Brell's Stalwart Shield [item=16772]\n- Spell: Crusader's Touch [item=16762]\n- Spell: Deny Undead [item=16763]\n- Spell: Force of Akilae [item=16764]\n- Spell: Greater Immobilize [item=16705]\n- Spell: Light of Nife [item=16766]\n- Spell: Pious Might [item=16767]\n- Spell: Quellious' Word of Serenity [item=16770]\n- Spell: Shackles of Tunare [item=16768]\n- Spell: Supernal Cleansing [item=16771]\n- Spell: Touch of Nife [item=16761]\n- Spell: Ward of Nife [item=16765]\n- Spell: Wave of Marr [item=16773]",
