      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n**Who:**\n- Tabben Bromal [ _Tinkering Supplies_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 50\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Crystalline Carapace [item=17508]\n- Dense Hammered Casing [item=17783]\n- Fiery Power Source [item=17784]\n- Locked Parts Box [item=26974]\n- Small Clockwork Talisman [item=16558]\n- Small Parts Container [item=27657]\n- Strands of Living Chain [item=17323]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Drunder, Fortress of Zek (Plane of Tactics) [zone=165]\n- Plane of Valor [zone=170]\n- Solusek Ro's Tower [zone=164]\n- Torment, the Plane of Pain [zone=167]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- A parylyx hatchling [npc=10530]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Jimlok's Friend (Clockwork Talisman #1) [quest=2202]\n- The Binden Concerrentia (Talisman #3) [quest=2288]\n**Era:** | !Planes of Power\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 18 21:26:19 2002\nModified: Fri Feb 2 16:00:22 2024 | | _At the end of the previous quest [quest=2202], Tabben Bromal asked you to let him know when you were ready to write down the names of the next set of parts and gave you a Small Parts Container._\n\n---\n\nCrystalline Carapace: Spiders in Plane of Valor\nStrands of Living Chain: Spiders in Plane of Torment\nDense Hammered Casing: Random Diakus in Drunder, Fortress of Zek (Plane of Tactics)\nFiery Power Source: Tower of Solusek Ro\nCombine these four pieces along with the first clockwork talisman in the Small Parts Container to craft a Locked Parts Box. Give this back to Tabben:\nTabben Bromal says 'Please take the schematic to Elder Clinka. I'm afraid that I don't have the courage to spend any more time working on this for you. I wish I had a more adventurous spirit, but I don't. I like it here because it's peaceful. I don't need anyone changing that for you. Take care and be cautious on your way to see her. There's no telling who or what may be after you! When you show her the schematic, you may want to mention that most of that writing wasn't on there when we got it.'\nTabben Bromal says 'It's seems that words are beginning to write themselves onto that schematic of yours. Maybe she'll be able to understand them. I sure don't want to. Take care.'\n_You receive the second talisman and The Talisman Schematic, which is used to start the third talisman quest._\n- Powered Clockwork Talisman [item=17785]\n- The Talisman Schematic [item=28881]",
