      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\nRating:\n0/6**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 6 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 60\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Guide\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Amorphous Cloud of Air [item=20744]\n- Crystalline Globe [item=17618]\n- Enchanted Ring of Torden [item=18300]\n- Globe of Dancing Flame [item=20743]\n- Mound of Living Stone [item=20645]\n- Odylic Vial [item=20756]\n- Quintessence of Elements [item=20754]\n- Sphere of Coalesced Water [item=19437]\n- Symbol of Torden [item=19208]\n- The Mark of Justice [item=22418]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Doomfire, the Burning Lands [zone=168]\n- Drunder, Fortress of Zek (Plane of Tactics) [zone=165]\n- Eryslai, the Kingdom of Wind [zone=175]\n- Halls of Honor [zone=171]\n- Lair of Terris Thule [zone=177]\n- Plane of Disease [zone=163]\n- Plane of Innovation [zone=160]\n- Plane of Justice [zone=162]\n- Plane of Nightmare [zone=161]\n- Plane of Storms [zone=172]\n- Plane of Time B [zone=178]\n- Plane of Tranquility [zone=159]\n- Plane of Valor [zone=170]\n- Ragrax, Stronghold of the Twelve [zone=184]\n- Reef of Coirnav [zone=166]\n- Ruins of Lxanvom (Crypt of Decay) [PoP]\n- Solusek Ro's Tower [zone=164]\n- Temple of Marr [zone=176]\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n- Torden, the Bastion of Thunder [zone=173]\n- Torment, the Plane of Pain [zone=167]\n- Vegarlson, the Earthen Badlands [zone=169]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- A Mystical Arbitor of Earth [npc=12945]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=28911]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=28908]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=28912]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=28910]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=28909]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=28913]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=28907]\n- A Planar Projection [npc=10739]\n- Adler Fuirstel [npc=10064]\n- Adroha Jezith [npc=10403]\n- Aerin`Dar [npc=10348]\n- Agnarr the Storm Lord [npc=10520]\n- Alekson Garn [npc=13290]\n- Arlyxir [npc=10464]\n- Askr the Lost [npc=10264]\n- Askr the Lost [npc=29327]\n- Avatar of Earth [npc=11726]\n- Bertoxxulous [npc=10385]\n- Chronographer Muon [npc=15337]\n- Coirnav the Avatar of Water [npc=11095]\n- Elder Fuirstel [npc=10407]\n- Elder Poxbourne [npc=13851]\n- Essence of Air [npc=11753]\n- Essence of Earth [npc=11730]\n- Essence of Fire [npc=11752]\n- Essence of Water [npc=11754]\n- Fahlia Shadyglade [npc=13850]\n- Fennin Ro, the Tyrant of Fire [npc=10778]\n- Giwin Mirakon [npc=10527]\n- Grand Librarian Maelin [npc=10635]\n- Grummus [npc=10244]\n- High Priest Ultor Szanvon [npc=10517]\n- Jiva [npc=10465]\n- Karana [npc=10698]\n- Lord Mithaniel Marr [npc=10342]\n- Maareq the Prophet [npc=10361]\n- Manaetic Behemoth [npc=10428]\n- Mavuin [npc=10113]\n- Miak the Searedsoul [npc=10404]\n- Rallos Zek the Warlord [npc=10359]\n- Rhaliq Trell [npc=10915]\n- Rizlona [npc=10463]\n- Rydda`Dar [npc=10596]\n- Saryrn [npc=10360]\n- Seer Mal Nae`Shi [npc=10140]\n- Solusek Ro [npc=10462]\n- Tallon Zek [npc=10357]\n- Taq`aal Emeraldshard [npc=13843]\n- Tarkil Adan [npc=13006]\n- Terris Thule [npc=10334]\n- Terris Thule [npc=28403]\n- The Keeper of Sorrows [npc=10362]\n- The Protector of Dresolik [npc=10466]\n- The Seventh Hammer [npc=10341]\n- The Tribunal [npc=10257]\n- Thelin Poxbourne [npc=10397]\n- Trydan Faye [npc=11162]\n- Tylis Newleaf [npc=28112]\n- Tylis Newleaf [npc=10893]\n- Vallon Zek [npc=10358]\n- Xanamech Nezmirthafen [npc=10234]\n- Xegony the Queen of Air [npc=11399]\n- Xuzl [npc=11052]\n- a construct of nightmares [npc=10370]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Access to Agnarr's Tower [quest=2333]\n- Access to the Elemental Planes [quest=2270]\n- Adler's Request - Crypt of Decay flag [quest=2210]\n- Aiding Askr (Bastion of Thunder Access) [quest=2269]\n- Alternate Access: Plane of Tactics [quest=2292]\n- Alternate Access: Plane of Torment [quest=2221]\n- Bastion of Thunder Towers Access [quest=2296]\n- Key to Aerin`Dar's Lair (HoH access) [quest=2481]\n- Key to Saryrn's Chambers [quest=2295]\n- Thelin's Torment (Access to the Lair of Terris Thule) [quest=2219]\n- Tylis's Condition (Saryrn Flag) [quest=2896]\n**Era:** | !Planes of Power\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Sep 5 18:18:09 2003\nModified: Tue Sep 3 09:08:23 2024 | | When dealing with Planar flags, always go through ALL quest texts. Don't use shortcuts -- if you miss even one minor flag, you won't be able to progress through the Planes. You can always backpedal, but figuring out what you're missing can prove tedious. When in doubt, speak with Seer Mal Nae`Shi in the Plane of Knowledge at -40, -200. Say \"Unlock memories\" until the quotes repeat or you see:\n**You manage to recover some images from your childhood, but no recent events spark a memory.**\nIf her replies are the same after multiple \"unlock memories\" and do not have the childhood quote, that is a clue to some flag(s) you are missing. Find the quote below for help on what to do. Now say \"Guided meditation.\" to determine what flags you have or are missing. Here is a list of the Seer's quotes, along with an interpretation of which flags/steps you are missing. A quote in **blue** indicates that you have completed this flag and are ready for more. In many cases, after you kill a god you must either hail a Planar Projection to receive credit for the kill or speak with the NPC that triggered the event. Note that some of the quotes will disappear as you progress through the Planes.\nTable of Contents:\nTier 1\nPlane of Justice [quest=2638]\nPlane of Disease [quest=2638]\nPlane of Nightmare [quest=2638]\nPlane of Innovation [quest=2638]\nTier 2\nPlane of Valor [quest=2638]\nPlane of Storms [quest=2638]\nRuins of Lxanvom [quest=2638]\nPlane of Torment [quest=2638]\nTier 3\nPlane of Tactics [quest=2638]\nBastion of Thunder [quest=2638]\nHalls of Honor [quest=2638]\nTower of Solusek Ro [quest=2638]\nTier 4\nElemental Planes [quest=2638]\nTier 5\nPlane of Time [quest=2638]\nMisc Information [quest=2638]\n\n---\n\n**Tier 1 - Plane of Justice** \\- PoJ Flag Guide [quest=2208]\n**The evidence of Mavuin is the only thing that can save him now.**\nPreflagged from Mavuin, or have completed a trial but did not say \"what evidence\" to a Tribunal.\n**Having endured the trials, the Tribunal has agreed to reconsider Mavuin's case.**\nYou have the preflag, completed the trial, and talked to the Tribunal, but have yet to go back and hail Mavuin.\n**Mavuin is grateful to you for taking his case before the Tribunal. The information provided to you, that Mithaniel Marr and Karana carry information you should seek, could be quite useful.**\nYou have saved Mavuin in one of the six Trials in the Plane of Justice and are flagged for the Plane of Valor and the Plane of Storms.\n**Tier 1 - Plane of Disease** \\- PoD Flag Guide [quest=2210]\n**Adler Fuirstel wishes you to obtain the Ward from the Plane of Disease and take it to his ill brother Milyk.**\nReceived Grummus preflag by saying \"What ward?\" to Adler Fuirstel next to Plane of Disease entrance. Grummus not defeated.\n**You remember seeing a small trinket by Grummus' body and wondering what it was for. Perhaps speaking to someone near the Plane of Disease will shed some light on the situation.**\nGrummus defeated, but you need preflag from Adler Fuirstel.\n**For a moment you pause, sticking your hand into your pocket. Inside you find the small ward that was lying near Grummus' body, perhaps you should bring it to Milyk.**\nGrummus killed and Planar Projection hailed, but have not finished by hailing Elder Fuirstel in Plane of Tranquility.\n**Grummus has been destroyed, about his corpse you found a small ward to protect from disease.**\nPreflag done and Grummus killed, but you have not returned to the sick bay in Plane of Tranquility and hailed Elder Fuirstel.\n**Now that Grummus has been destroyed, the entrance to the Crypt of Bertoxxulous should open before your might.**\nGrummus flag completed. You are flagged for Crypt of Decay/Ruins of Lxanvom.\n**Tier 1 - Plane of Nightmare** \\- Lair of Terris Thule Flag Guide [quest=2219] \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**Thelin being tormented by the imagery of Terris Thule needs assistance escaping from the Plane of Nightmares.**\nHedge maze preflag. You hailed Elder Poxbourne, then hailed Adroha Jezith and said \"tortured by nightmares.\"\n**Thelin has completed his pact with Terris Thule, but has been refused. The only way to escape his torment now is to destroy Terris Thule.**\nHedge event done, and you went back to sick bay and hailed Elder Poxbourne and Adroha again. You are flagged to enter the Lair of Terris Thule. Terris Thule not defeated in PoNb/Lair of Terris Thule yet.\n**Terris still haunts your nightmares whenever you attemt to recall your battle with her.**\nTerris Thule defeated, but either the PoN hedge event was not completed and or the preflags for it weren't.\n**Terris Thule's grasp over Thelin has been released**\nTerris Thule has been defeated, Hedge event and preflags complete, but you have yet to hail Elder Poxbourne in sick bay to complete cycle.\n**Saved from a world of eternal nightmares, Thelin is forever in your debt.**\nTerris Thule flag completed.\n**Tier 1 - Plane of Innovation** \\- Key to Factory Guide [quest=2207] \\- Destroy the Behemoth [quest=2234] \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**You remember Nitram's words - 'three small turns to the right on the bottommost rivet should open the door'.**\nXanamech Nezmirthafen killed and Nitram Anizok hailed. You have access to the Plane of Innovation factory (not required for progression).\n**Giwin's invitation to Drunder reminds you of some notes you found around Vallon's body.**\nReceived after talking to Giwin inside the factory, having already been flagged for killing the behemoth. Note: had to say \"test the machine\" to Giwin without prompting since he gives the alternate quest when hailed.\n**Giwin would like you to find him in Drunder so he can present you to Rallos Zek.**\nSaid to Giwin Mirakon, \"I will test the machine.\" Manaetic Behemoth killed. Zoned into Plane of Tactics. You are flagged for Plane of Tactics/Drunder, Fortress of Zek, but haven't killed either of the Zeks yet.\n**Tier 2 - Plane of Valor** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**You have defeated Aerin`Dar but have yet to learn the true meaning of Justice.**\nAerin`Dar killed, but you have not completed a Trial in Plane of Justice.\n**You have bested Aerin`Dar and proven yourself honorable enough to pass into Mithaniel's Halls.**\nAerin`Dar killed. You are flagged for Halls of Honor (not actually required for planar progression, since you can use the 85% rule to get piggybacked into Temple of Marr once in Halls of Honor, then kill Mithaniel Marr there to get your flag).\n**Tier 2 - Plane of Storms** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**You recall meeting with Karana, but the memory is clouded. You sense that the answer you seek may be in Storms.**\nYou have not completed the Plane of Storms key quest for Bastion of Thunder.\n**You have shown your prowess in battle to Askr, now you must make strides to get to the Bastion of Thunder.**\nYou turned in the bone, beard, and sash, but have yet to turn in the medallions, or you have turned in everything but have yet to complete a Trial in the Plane of Justice.\n**You have obtained the Talisman of Thunderous Foyer from Askr, he seeks further assistance in the Bastion of Thunder.**\nYou have successfully completed assisting Askr and have entered the Bastion of Thunder.\n**Tier 2 - Ruins of Lxanvom (a.k.a. Crypt of Decay)** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\nBertoxxulous has been slain by Soandso!\nA nimbus of light floods throughs the crypt in one magnificent wave as an earth shattering howl is heard. The bringer of plagues, lord of all disease and decay, Bertoxxulous has been defeated. Suddenly an urgent whisper fills your head simply saying, 'The Torch of Lxanvom shall burn bright again. Freedom is now ours, for that we thank you.'\nYou say, 'Hail, a planar projection'\nMilyk Fuirstel's thoughts enter into your own. 'Bertoxxulous is slain, for this my brother and I are forever in your debt. Please, when you have the opportunity come visit me in the Plane of Tranquility. I would like to thank you face to face.'\nYou've received a character flag!\nYou say, 'Hail, Elder Fuirstel'\nElder Fuirstel tells you, 'Welcome back friend. I must tell you that my brother and I shall never forget what you have done for us. We have since renounced our following of Bertoxxulous, for in him we only found suffering. We have joined a new following, learning from the gods without their direct influence over us. I shall not keep you though, thank you once again!'\nYou've received a character flag!\n**Milyk has been saved from certain death, but is not recovering. Only by destroying the ruler of all things pestilent will his curse be lifted.**\nBertoxxulous preflag: you killed Grummus and hailed Adler Fuirstel near Plane of Disease entrance and Elder Fuirstel in sick bay.\n**You focus back to your battle with the Plaguebringer, memories of his death give you a moment of clarity. You now have the knowledge to help Milyk. - (We need detail on what this means)**\n**Bertoxxulous has been slain. The curse from Milyk has been lifted.**\nBertoxxulous killed and Planar Projection hailed, but have not completed by hailing Adler and Elder.\n**As you recall your memory of your battle against the Plaguebringer, an image of the Fuirstel brothers flashes through your mind.**\nBertoxxulous killed, but you don't have the Grummus flag.\n**Saved from certain doom, Milyk and Adler are forever in your debt.**\nBertoxxulous flag completed.\n**Tier 2 - Plane of Torment** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**Tylis is being tortured by Saryrn. The only way for him to get away from his misery is to escape from the Plane of Torment.** See this quest entry [quest=2896] for this portion.\nSaryrn preflag from hailing Fahlia Shadyglade and saying \"I will go.\" (Saying \"I will go to the Plane of Torment.\" puts you in a dialogue loop.) You _must_ have Terris Thule _and_ Bertoxxulous flags complete.\n**Although it was kind of you to help him, Tylis still seems to have no idea who you are.**\nYou have killed the Keeper of Sorrows, but do not have the Saryrn preflag.\n**Tylis has been removed from his agony.**\nKeeper of Sorrows killed. All prerequisites in place.\n**You attempt to recall your defeat of Saryrn, but whenever you try to focus you feel a searing pain on your arm.**\nSaryrn killed, but there's a problem with the preflag, postflag, Maareq the Prophet event, Terris Thule chain, or Bertoxxulous chain.\n**You feel the searing pain of torment as half of the Cipher of the Gods glows on your arm.**\nSaryrn chain complete. Mithaniel Marr chain incomplete.\n**Saryrn has been destroyed. An aura surrounds the mystical symbols that have appeared on your arm.**\nSaryrn completed, but you have not yet hailed Grand Librarian Maelin after completing the Mithaniel Marr chain.\n**The Cipher of the Divine Language appears on your arms for a brief moment then fades.**\nCompleted Saryrn and Mithaniel Marr flag lines and hailed Grand Librarian Maelin. Grummus, Terris Thule, Bertoxxulous, Keeper of Sorrows, Saryrn, Halls of Honor trials, Mithaniel Marr, and all preflagging completed.\n**Tier 3 - Drunder, Fortress of Zek (a.k.a. Plane of Tactics)** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**The pack of notes from Vallon are scribbled in a language that you cannot comprehend.**\nDefeated Vallon Zek and hailed Planar Projection (disappears after you get MM/Saryrn/TZ/VZ and talk with Librarian).\n**Vallon fell before you with great ease, you seem to remember some strange pouches around his body, but... well it's probably nothing.**\nVallon killed, Planar Projection hailed, but missing Manaetic Behemoth kill or preflag.\n**Tallon fell before you with great ease, you seem to remember some strange pouches around his body, but well it's probably nothing.**\nTallon killed, Planar Projection hailed, but missing Manaetic Behemoth kill or preflag.\n**The pack of notes from Tallon are scribbled in a language that you cannot comprehend.**\nDefeated Tallon Zek and hailed Planar Projection (disappears after you get MM/Saryrn/TZ/VZ and talk with Librarian).\n**The parchments of Rallos are scribed in a language that you cannot comprehend; they do however have detailed drawings of the manaetic behemoth that you have already destroyed.**\nYou are missing part of the Cipher and are not yet flagged for the elemental planes.\n**Giwin would like you to find him in Drunder so he can present you to Rallos Zek.**\nYou have defeated the Behemoth and have access to Tactics (Tallon Zek and Vallon Zek not killed yet).\n**The words of Maelin echo in your mind, 'The Zeks and Solusek are planning an invasion in Norrath, find out more from Rallos if you can.'**\nHave Mithaniel Marr/Saryrn/Tallon Zek/Vallon Zek flags (and prerequisites completed). Said \"new lore\" to Maelin in the library. Have not yet killed Rallos Zek the Warlord. Flagged to enter Tower of Solusek Ro.\n**Your heart beat speeds as you recall the Warlord's flaming axe, behind the dark sockets of his helm you sense darker intentions.**\nRallos Zek the Warlord defeated.\nAfter killing Rallos Zek talk to Maelin and say \"I have information\"; you will receive a character flag. That will turn \"The History translated for you reveals the fate of Zebuxoruk ...\" into \"Learning of Zebuxoruk's fate ...\"\n**Tier 3 - Torden, the Bastion of Thunder** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**You have obtained the Talisman of Thunderous Foyer from Askr, he seeks further assistance in the Bastion of Thunder.**\nYou are flagged to enter the Bastion of Thunder, but have not yet completed Agnarr.\n**You recall meeting with Karana, but the memory is clouded. You sense that the answer you seek may be in Storms.**\nYou have killed Agnarr and talked to Karana, but aren't yet flagged to enter Bastion of Thunder.\n**The information obtained from Karana is written in a language that you cannot comprehend.**\nAgnarr flag done. You have not hailed librarian after completing Mithaniel Marr path.\n**As you think back to your meeting with Karana the Talisman in your chest warms and a light rain falls from the sky. When you look down, a small book written in a language you can not read, rests in your hands.**\nAgnarr and Karana completed, but you have not said \"what lore\" to librarian.\n**The History translated for you reveals the fate of Zebuxoruk. Trapped in the Plane of Time you must gain the power of the elements to gain entrance.**\nMithaniel Marr/Agnarr completed. Said \"new lore\" to Maelin in the library. Do not have Rallos Zek the Warlord flag.\n**Tier 3 - Halls of Honor (HoHa) and Temple of Marr (HoHb)** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**You have beaten Rydda`Dar in the first of Honor's trials.**\nYou completed the Rydda`Dar trial (changes when other 2 are finished and Mithaniel Marr is defeated).\n**You have saved the villagers in the second of Honor's Trials.**\nYou completed the Ogre trial (changes when other 2 are finished and Mithaniel Marr is defeated).\n**You have defeated the nomads in the third of Honor's trials.**\nYou completed the Madmen trial (changes when other 2 are finished and Mithaniel Marr is defeated).\n**You have completed all of Honor's Trials.**\n3 trials in Halls of Honor completed.\n**The information obtained from Mithaniel is written in a language that you cannot comprehend.**\nMithaniel Marr done, but have not hailed librarian after completing Agnarr path.\n**An image of Mithaniel flashes before you. You have yet to earn a place of Honor. When you have, we will speak again.**\nYou were piggybacked into Temple of Marr and killed Mithaniel Marr, but are missing one or more of the trials.\n**An image of Mithaniel flashes before you. He looks up from a small book in his hands and smiles at you. You have not yet earned the Honor to see these words.**\nYou have killed both Mithaniel and Agnarr, but have unfinished Halls of Honor flags (usually seen together with the above). You can also see this without having killed Agnarr, but after being piggybacked into a Mithaniel Marr raid with the trials not completed.\n**The History translated for you reveals the fate of Zebuxoruk. Trapped in the Plane of Time you must gain the power of the elements to gain entrance.**\nMithaniel Marr/Agnarr completed. Said \"new lore\" to Maelin in the library. Do not have Rallos Zek the Warlord flag.\n**Mithaniel has been bested. An aura surrounds the mystical symbols that have appeared on your arm.**\nMithaniel Marr defeated, but have not hailed librarian after completing Saryrn chain.\n**The Cipher of the Divine Language appears on your arms for a brief moment then fades.**\nCompleted Saryrn and Mithaniel Marr flag lines and hailed Grand Librarian Maelin. Grummus, Terris Thule, Bertoxxulous, Keeper of Sorrows, Saryrn, Halls of Honor trials, Mithaniel Marr, and all preflagging completed.\n**To enter the Tower of Solusek Ro, you must have the following at a minimum: (Grummus, Terris Thule, Bertoxxulous, Keeper of Sorrows, Saryrn, Halls of Honor trials, Mithaniel Marr, Tallon Zek, Vallon Zek)**\n**Mavuin is grateful to you for taking his case before the Tribunal. The information provided to you, that Mithaniel Marr and Karana carry information you should seek, could be quite useful.**\nYou have saved Mavuin in one of the six Trials in the Plane of Justice and are flagged for the Plane of Valor and the Plane of Storms.\n**Now that Grummus has been destroyed, the entrance to the Crypt of Bertoxxulous should open before your might.**\nGrummus flag completed. You are flagged for Crypt of Decay/Ruins of Lxanvom.\n**Saved from a world of eternal nightmares, Thelin is forever in your debt.**\nTerris Thule flag completed.\n**Saved from certain doom, Milyk and Adler are forever in your debt.**\nBertoxxulous flag completed.\n**Tylis has been removed from his agony.**\nKeeper of Sorrows killed. All prerequisites in place.\n**You have completed all of Honor's Trials.**\n3 trials in Halls of Honor completed.\n**The Cipher of the Divine Language appears on your arms for a brief moment then fades.**\nSaryrn and Mithaniel Marr flags completed.\n**The words of Maelin echo in your mind, 'The Zeks and Solusek are planning an invasion of Norrath, find out more from Rallos if you can.**\nTallon Zek and Vallon Zek flags completed.\n**Tier 3 - Tower of Solusek Ro** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**Arlyxir's wealth of knowledge flows through your mind.**\n**Jiva's strength fills your body.**\n**The power of Dresolik surges through you.**\n**Xuzl's arcane wisdom pulses in your mind.**\n**Rizlona's song slips through your thoughts.**\nThe five ToSR minibosses and what you see after you beat each one (these will not appear if you have not hailed Miak in Plane of Tranquility for Doomfire, the Burning Planes/Plane of Fire preflag).\n**Besting the Burning Prince proves your might, but you still must prove your warrior's spirit.**\nHave killed Solusek Ro but the Tactics chain is not yet complete.\n**Tier 4 - Elemental Planes: Doomfire, the Burning Planes (Elemental Plane of Fire); Eryslai, the Kingdom of Wind (Elemental Plane of Air); Reef of Coirnav (Elemental Plane of Water); Vegarlson, the Earthen Badlands (Elemental Plane of Earth A); Ragrax, Stronghold of the Twelve (Elemental Plane of Earth B)** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**Learning of Zebuxoruk's fate, the only way to save him is gather materials that will allow you to power up the machine to send you into the Plane of Time. Maelin has charged you with finding an elemental power source sufficient to activate Meldrath's time machine.**\nRallos Zek and Agnarr flags completed. Have access to Planes of Air, Earth (A), and Water.\n**The portal into the Plane of Fire has been altered. Miak needs you to find the correct way to channel the portal.**\nPreflag to killing Solusek Ro.\n**The true route to the Plane of Fire is now clear in your mind.**\nSolusek Ro and Rallos Zek defeated (and have all prerequisites). You are flagged to enter the Plane of Fire. The messages for the five mini-bosses disappear once you have this.\n**Tier 5 - Plane of Time** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**Your soul has formed a bond with the Plane of Time. You can now pass through the portal in the Plane of Tranquility safely.**\nYou are flagged to enter the Plane of Time!\nAfter running the first trial and zoning back to Plane of Tranquility, this message displays.\n**The cipher on your arm glows for a moment as the words of history fill your mind. The knowledge you have gained now grants you access to the planes of the Elemental Gods.**\n**Miscellaneous information** \\- Go to Top [quest=2638]\n**Access to Planes of Disease, Innovation, Justice, Nightmare, and Tranquility**\nLevels 46 and up.\n**Access to Planes of Storm, Torment, and Valor, and the Ruins of Lxanvom (Crypt of Decay)**\nLevels 55 and up.\n**Access to Torden, the Bastion of Thunder and the Halls of Honor**\nLevels 62 and up.\n**Alternate access**\nCertain zones are accessible through alternate means, although the\n\n...[Walkthrough truncated for in-game performance]...",
