      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 20\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Guide\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Armour Set\n- Tradeskill\n**Quest Items:**\n- Compacted Backpack [item=34082]\n- Crescent Essence [item=52542]\n- Crushed Diamond Dust [item=12390]\n- Drachnid Silk Swatch [item=34354]\n- Embroidering Needle [item=14462]\n- Fire Opal [item=2836]\n- Glossy Drake Hide [item=34367]\n- High Quality Firing Sheet [item=14354]\n- Huge Block of Clay [item=34078]\n- Jade Shard [item=5953]\n- Lambent Stone [item=2966]\n- Large Bottle of Ink [item=34080]\n- Metallic Drake Scales [item=34083]\n- Nightmare Arachnid Swatch [item=17006]\n- Purescale Ore [item=34084]\n- Roll of Good Quality Vellum [item=34749]\n- Roll of High Quality Vellum [item=34750]\n- Roll of Plain Parchment [item=34079]\n- Roll of Superb Vellum [item=34751]\n- Roll of Vellum [item=34748]\n- Sculpting Tools [item=14674]\n- Shissar Scales [item=17378]\n- Silk Swatch [item=14242]\n- Warbone Chips [item=5567]\n- Water Flask [item=7773]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Ak'Anon [zone=54]\n- Cabilis East [zone=96]\n- Erudin [zone=67]\n- Greater Faydark [zone=56]\n- Grobb [zone=8]\n- Halas [zone=11]\n- Neriak Commons [zone=34]\n- North Qeynos [zone=4]\n- Northern Felwithe [zone=55]\n- Oggok [zone=9]\n- Paineel [zone=69]\n- Rivervale [zone=12]\n- Shar Vahl [zone=155]\n- South Kaladim [zone=52]\n- The Rathe Mountains 2.0 [zone=26]\n- West Freeport 2.0 [zone=2]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Artisan Bill Whistletop [ _Trade Skill Quests_]\n- Artisan Calian Silverlake [npc=17666]\n- Artisan Dosan Vis`moor [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Elistar Vorann [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Garth Okken [ _Trade Skill Quests_]\n- Artisan Gorion Telld`Mare [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Kjell Sunrunner [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Korzan Virimove [npc=17670]\n- Artisan Sieeva Koan [ _Trade Skill Quests_]\n- Artisan Srekta Froreki [npc=17685]\n- Artisan Tar Cordell [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Vidi Cogsworthy [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Vivian Selgan [ _Trade Skill Quests_]\n- Artisan Vor Westrider [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Vuro Padfoot [ _Tradeskill Quests_]\n- Artisan Yar Shiverbrow [npc=17672]\n- Artisan Zermak [npc=17673]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Barbarian Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3044]\n- Dark Elf Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3045]\n- Drakkin Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=4149]\n- Dwarf Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3049]\n- Erudite Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3043]\n- Froglok Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3052]\n- Gnome Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3046]\n- Half Elf Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3039]\n- Halfling Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3042]\n- High Elf Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3040]\n- Human Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3038]\n- Iksar Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3050]\n- Ogre Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3048]\n- Troll Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3047]\n- Vah Shir Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3051]\n- Wood Elf Cultural Armor (DoN) [quest=3041]\n**Era:** | !Dragons of Norrath\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Feb 25 15:26:27 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Notice: Cultural tradeskills were recently given a major overhaul. Much of this information may be outdated.**\n**We would like to have this guide on the wiki. The wiki article about Dragons of Norrath Cultural Armor can be found here. If you have any information to contribute, you can do so directly if you desire.**\n\n---\n\nThis is an overview of how Cultural Armor quests in Dragons of Norrath work. For more detailed information related to individual races, use the quest links on the lefthand side of this writeup.\nThis cultural armor works in tiers (note the indicated levels are requirements for getting the tasks from quest NPCs; you can make the low-stat armor at earlier levels, but not the augmentations):\nFirst Tier: Simple\n-Tradeskill components obtainable at 30th level.\nSecond Tier: Ornate\n-Tradeskill components obtainable at 40th level.\nThird Tier: Intricate\n-Tradeskill components obtainable at 60th level.\nFourth Tier: Elaborate\n-Tradeskill components obtainable earlier than 70th level, but you won't be able to get the task for the required book until then.\nThere are plate, chain, leather, and silk armor combines. Plate and chain is done through smithing in cultural forges. Leather and silk is done through tailoring in cultural sewing kits.\nNote that mold and pattern combines produce an eight-slot backpack full with the following items:\n20x Chest Slot\n20x Legs Slot\n20x Arms Slot\n20x Head Slot\n20x Hands Slot\n20x Feet Slot\n40x Wrist Slot\nNavigation: The Books [quest=3056] \\| Armor Production [quest=3056] \\| Symbol (Aug) Production [quest=3056] \\| Trivials [quest=3056] \\| Appendix [quest=3056]\n(Links found in this guide go to a same-page appendix.)\n..........................................................................................................................\n**Obtain Armor Books**\nSee the \"Tradeskill Quests\" [quest=3056] NPC in your home city. Perform tasks to obtain an Ancestral Armor Book, Simple Book, Ornate Book, Intricate Book, and Elaborate Book.\n..........................................................................................................................\n**Smithing Recipes:**\nMOLDS = Ancestral Armor Book + High Quality Firing Sheet + Huge Block of Clay + Compacted Backpack + Sculpting Tools\nBARS [quest=3056] = Cultural Metal [quest=3056] \\+ Item Drop [quest=3056] \\+ Cultural Hammer [quest=3056]\nSHEETS [quest=3056] = Cultural Hammer [quest=3056] \\+ Water Flask + (Tier's) Bar [quest=3056] (made in the above combine)\nARMOR PRODUCTION [quest=3056] = Armor Mold + # (Tier's) Sheet(s)/Bar(s) [quest=3056] \\+ Large Brick of Cultural Metal [quest=3056] \\+ Cultural Hammer [quest=3056]\n\\*\\*NOTE: # is 3 for Chest and Legs; 2 for Feet and Head; 1 for Arms, Hands, and Wrists\n\\*\\*NOTE: Chain combines use BARS; Plate combines use SHEETS\n_This produces armor with minor stats and augmentation slots 7, 11, 12._\n\\- \\- \\- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n**Tailoring Recipes:**\nNEEDLE [quest=3056] = Embroidering Needle + Cultural Brewing Essence [quest=3056]\nSEWING KIT [quest=3056] = Water Flask + Needle Mold + Thimble Mold + Small Brick of Cultural Metal [quest=3056]\n\\*\\*NOTE: Just to make things a little more complicated, Wood Elves and Halflings use bits instead of a small brick.\nPATTERNS = Ancestral Armor Book + Roll of Plain Parchment + Large Bottle of Ink + Compacted Backpack + A Quill\nSWATCHES [quest=3056] = Cultural Spool of Thread [quest=3056] \\+ Cultural Needle [quest=3056] \\+ Culture-Specific Silk Swatch or Dropped Hide/Pelt [quest=3056]\nARMOR PRODUCTION [quest=3056] = Armor Pattern + # (Tier's) Swatch(es) [quest=3056] (produced in the above combine) + Large Spool of Cultural Thread [quest=3056] \\+ Cultural Needle [quest=3056]\n\\\\*\\\\* NOTE: # is 3 for Chest and Legs; 2 for Feet and Head; 1 for Arms, Hands, and Wrists\n_This produces armor with minor stats and augmentation slots 7, 11, 12._\n..........................................................................................................................\n**The Symbols (Augmentations)**\nSymbols can be made by anyone of any deity in any culture's forge or sewing kit.\nSYMBOL PATTERN PRODUCTION:\nInside a Book Binding (bought from local vendors), produce (Tier's) (Slot) Symbol Pattern:\nRecipe = (Tier's) Book of (Race) Culture + Compacted Backpack + A Quill + Large Bottle of Ink + Roll of Vellum\n(\\*\\*Quality of Vellum varies by Tier: Blessed = Roll; Revered = Good; Sacred = High Quality; Eminent = Superb)\n**Blessed Water of ( Deity [quest=3056])** can be bought from local vendors.\n**JEWELCRAFT COMBINES:**\nBlessed Water of ( Deity Name [quest=3056]) = Blessed Water + Jade Shard\nRevered Water of ( Deity Name [quest=3056]) = Blessed Water + Lambent Stone\nSacred Water of ( Deity Name [quest=3056]) = Blessed Water + Crushed Diamond Dust\nEminent Water of ( Deity Name [quest=3056]) = Blessed Water + Purescale Ore\n**SLOT 11 AUGMENTATION PRODUCTION (SMITHED):**\n(Tier's) (Armor) Symbol of (Deity Name)\n**Recipe** = (Tier's) Water of (Deity Name) + (Tier's) (Slot) Symbol Pattern + Item\n( _\\*\\*Item varies by Tier: Blessed = Warbone Chips; Revered = Fire Opal; Sacred = Shissar Scales; Eminent = Metallic Drake Scales_)\n**SLOT 11 AUGMENTATION PRODUCTION (TAILORED):**\n(Tier's) (Armor) Symbol of (Deity Name)\n**Recipe** = (Tier's) Water of (Deity Name) + (Tier's) (Slot) Symbol Pattern + Item\n( _\\*\\*Item varies by Tier: Blessed = Silk Swatch; Revered = Drachnid Silk Swatch; Sacred = Nightmare Arachnid Swatch; Eminent = Glossy Drake Hide_)\n..........................................................................................................................\n**MATERIAL TRIVIALS**\nSewing Kits - 162\nNeedles - 122\nSimple Swatches - 62\nOrnate Swatches - 122\nIntricate Swatches - 182\nElaborate Swatches - 242\nSimple Bars - 62\nOrnate Bars - 122\nIntricate Bars - 182\nElaborate Bars - 242\nSimple Sheets - 15 (no fail?)\nOrnate Sheets - 15 (no fail?)\nIntricate Sheets - 15 (no fail?)\nElaborate Sheets - 15 (no fail?)\nBlessed Water of (deity name) - 56\nRevered Water of (deity name) - 68\nSacred Water of (deity name) - 82\nEminent Water of (deity name) - 95\n**ARMOR TRIVIALS** (armor and symbol trivials coincide with one another):\nSimple Boots - 120\nSimple Chest - 139\nSimple Gloves - 120\nSimple Helm - 120\nSimple Legs - 139\nSimple Sleeves - 134\nSimple Wrist - 115\nOrnate Boots - 192\nOrnate Chest - 222\nOrnate Gloves - 192\nOrnate Helm - 192\nOrnate Legs - 222\nOrnate Sleeves - 212\nOrnate Wrist - 182\nIntricate Boots - 263\nIntricate Chest - 304\nIntricate Gloves - 263\nIntricate Helm - 263\nIntricate Legs - 304\nIntricate Sleeves - 290\nIntricate Wrist - 248\nElaborate Boots - Unconfirmed\nElaborate Chest - Unconfirmed\nElaborate Gloves - Unconfirmed\nElaborate Helm - Unconfirmed\nElaborate Legs - Unconfirmed\nElaborate Sleeves - Unconfirmed\nElaborate Wrist - Unconfirmed\n..........................................................................................................................\n**The Appendix**\n\\- \\- \\- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nTradeskill Quest NPCs...\nBarbarian - Artisan Kjell Sunrunner (+155, +388 Golden Torque)\nDark Elf - Artisan Dosan Vis`Moor (+87, -887 in the Blind Fish)\nDrakkin - Artisan Irisi (-1350, -1590, second floor, near the banker)\nDwarf - Artisan Yar Shiverbrow (Kaladim South)\nErudite - Artisan Gorion Telld`Mare (Erudin Dock) or Artisan Korzan Virimove (Paineel)\nFroglok - Artisan Srekta Froreki (Rathe Mountains, **/loc?**)\nGnome - Artisan Vidi Cogsworthy (+829, -128, +2 King's Building)\nHalf Elf - Artisan Vor Westrider (Qeynos North)\nHalfling - Artisan Bill Whistletop\nHigh Elf - Artisan Elistar Voran\nHuman - Artisan Vivian Selgan (West Freeport Theater) or Artisan Tar Cordell (Qeynos North)\nIksar - Artisan Sieeva Koan (Cabilis East)\nOgre - Artisan Garth Okken\nTroll - Artisan Zermak (Grobb, **/loc?**)\nVah Shir - Artisan Vuro Padfoot (Shar Vahl, -435, -40)\nWood Elf - Artisan Calian Silverlake\n\\- \\- \\- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nCultural Hammers (Bought at Local Vendors)...\nBarbarian - Northman Smithy Hammer\nDark Elf - Teir'Dal Smithy Hammer\nDrakkin - Crystalwing Smithy Hammer\nDwarf - Dwarven Smithy Hammer\nErudite - Erud Smithy Hammer\nFroglok - Froglok Smithy Hammer\nGnome - Gnomish Smithy Hammer\nHalf Elf - Combine Smithy Hammer\nHalfling - Vale Smithy Hammer\nHigh Elf - Elven Smithy Hammer\nHuman - Antonican Smithy Hammer\nIksar - Cabilisian Smithy Hammer\nOgre - Ogrish Smithy Hammer\nTroll - Troll Smithy Hammer\nVah Shir - Vah Shir Smithy Hammer\nWood Elf - Fier`Dal Smithy Hammer\n\\- \\- \\- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nCultural Metals/Ores (Bought at Local Vendors)...\nBarbarian - High Quality Ore\nDark Elf - Adamantite Ore\nDrakkin - ????\nDwarf - Brellium Ore\nErudite - Titanium\nFroglok - Valorite\nGnome - Fortified Bronze\nHalf Elf - Rilsteel\nHalfling - Mercurium\nHigh Elf - Mithril Ore\nHuman - High Quality Ore\nIksar - Skyiron\nOgre - Adamantite Ore\nTroll - Iron\nVah Shir - Ancestral Acrylia\nWood Elf - Mithril\n\\- \\- \\- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nItem Drops (ORDER: Simple, Ornate, Intricate, Elaborate)...\nBarbarian - Permafrost Crystals, Chunk of Condensed Ice, Pile of Gravel, Metallic Drake Scales\nDark Elf - Russet Oxide, Small Piece of Acrylia, Midnight Stone, Metallic Drake Scales\nDrakkin - ????\nDwarf - Warbone Chips, Lava Rock, Pile of Gravel, Metallic Drake Scales\nErudite - Shark Bones, Drop of Mercury, Midnight Stone, Metallic Drake Scales\nFroglok - Barbed Bone Chips, Gargoyle Eye, Great Reptile Tooth, Metallic Drake Scales\nGnome - Warbone Chips, Chunk of Condensed Flame, Small Brick of Yttrium Ore, Metallic Drake Scales\nHalf Elf - Permafrost Crystals, Fungus Sap, Great Reptile Tooth, Metallic Drake Scales\nHalfling - Ivory, Drop of Mercury, Small Brick of Yttrium Ore, Metallic Drake Scales\nHigh Elf - Pouch of Mistletoe Powder, Fungus Sap, Small Brick of Yttrium Ore, Metallic Drake Scales\nHuman - Small Mammoth Tusks, Woolly Rhino Horn, Pile of Gravel, Metallic Drake Scales\nIksar - Loose Scales, Small Piece of Velium, Great Reptile Tooth, Metallic Drake Scales\nOgre - Barbed Bone Chips, Dark Ore, Pile of Gravel, Metallic Drake Scales\nTroll - Barbed Bone Chips, Globe of Fear, Great Reptile Tooth, Metallic Drake Scales\nVah Shir - Porous Mineral Block, Brick of Black Acrylia, Small Brick of Yttrium Ore, Metallic Drake Scales\nWood Elf - Pouch of Mistl