      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n**Who:**\n- Grand Librarian Maelin [npc=10635]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Battleground Soot [item=48377]\n- Bone Tattoo Comb [item=48503]\n- Decorated Wurine Hide [item=48498]\n- Scarred Bolvirk Skin [item=48508]\n- Scarred and Tattooed Skin [item=48586]\n- Tattooed Shiliskin Skin [item=48585]\n- Torn and Tattooed Orc Flesh [item=48580]\n- Warrior's Blood [item=48501]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Sverag, Stronghold of Rage [zone=341]\n- The Devastation [zone=339]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Become the Vessel (Razorthorn Access) [quest=3428]\n- Saga Skins [quest=3427]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Apr 21 23:59:06 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is the second of three tasks for Razorthorn access, and is automatically assigned at the end of the \"Saga Skins\" task._\nGrand Librarian Maelin has concocted a plan that may allow you to get into Sullon Zek's tower. It seems like a crazy idea, but since he's not risking himself, Maelin seems enthusiatic about it.\nLoot 1 Bone Tattoo Comb\nLoot 5 Warrior's Blood\nLoot 5 Battleground Soot\nDeliver 1 Bone Tattoo Comb to Grand Librarian Maelin\nDeliver 5 Warrior's Blood to Grand Librarian Maelin\nDeliver 5 Battleground Soot to Grand Librarian Maelin\n_The task description then adds the following..._\nNow give Maelin the skins. He will fashion each into a piece of armor for you to wear.\nDeliver 1 Scarred Bolvirk Skin to Grand Librarian Maelin\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'Ah, this one is a large piece, we'd best turn this into a tunic.'\n_You receive Enraged Flesh Tunic_\nDeliver 1 Torn and Tattooed Orc Flesh to Grand Librarian Maelin\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'This should be large enough to make some reasonable leggings.'\n_You receive Enraged Flesh Leggings_\nDeliver 1 Tattooed Shiliskin Skin to Grand Librarian Maelin\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'This might be a bit disgusting, but I'll make this into a cap for you.'\n_You receive Enraged Flesh Helm_\nDeliver 1 Scarred and Tattooed Skin to Grand Librarian Maelin\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'I think I can make some sleeves from this. Not pretty, but that's of little concern.'\n_You receive Enraged Flesh Sleeves_\nDeliver 1 Decorated Wurine Hide to Grand Librarian Maelin\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'Well, this might actually make some comfortable gloves!'\n_You receive Enraged Flesh Gloves_\nWith that armor you might be able to appear as though you are one of those that belong in the Plane of Rage. If Sullon is willing and you prove yourself worthy, she might allow you into her tower. Gather some friends and return to Maelin and he will set you on the proper course. Just let him know when you are ready to [become the Vessel].\n_See link to quest \"Become the Vessel\" for further details._\n- Enraged Flesh Cap [item=48606]\n- Enraged Flesh Gloves [item=48607]\n- Enraged Flesh Leggings [item=48608]\n- Enraged Flesh Sleeves [item=48609]\n- Enraged Flesh Tunic [item=48610]",
