ing Gem of Jexlplix to Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nGive the Glowing Gem of Kagzinai to Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nGive the Glowing Gem of Lerabdi to Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nGive the Glowing Gem of Juytabu to Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nGive the Glowing Gem of Xalzinai to Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nGive the Glowing Gem of Zarinarn to Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nSpeak with Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\n_You receive a \"Wand of Shocking\" to be used in the next task of the series (a task involving Kael Drakkel, \"Masters of Fear\")._\n_Rewards:_\n337.5 pp\nExperience (4 AA's or 2% of level 99)\n- Wand of Shocking [item=108531]",
